(7478362, 1189095, 163081, '<td valign="top">Wow. I like you couldn''t adjust the tilt. That solitaire pigeon makes the whole scene come alive. The sun peeping between the skyscrapers adds the final touch. The fence is taking 2/3 of the picture but is not dominant. My top 3, a 10 and my Red dragon Award <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173262" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Wow. I like you couldn''t adjust the tilt. That solitaire pigeon makes the whole scene come alive. The sun peeping between the skyscrapers adds the final touch. The fence is taking 2/3 of the picture but is not dominant. My top 3, a 10 and my Red dragon Award ', '2016-10-14 04:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7478363, 1188579, 163081, '<td valign="top">Great image, in my top 3. The horse is really talking to the viewer in this picture. Vibrant colors making the whole so natural. A 9 from me.</td>', 'Great image, in my top 3. The horse is really talking to the viewer in this picture. Vibrant colors making the whole so natural. A 9 from me.', '2016-10-14 04:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
