(7478848, 1189085, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the fence, the DOF and the setting. I don''t like the composition, sorry. The post that is in focus is too centered and the post on the right is very distracting. The photo would have been much better if the right was cropped off (just realized this is minimal editing and you can''t crop - but you could have composed it that way in camera). Then you have a much stronger photo with no distracting post on the right and the main post would start on the right and lead your eyes down the fence right through the photo.</td>', 'I like the fence, the DOF and the setting. I don''t like the composition, sorry. The post that is in focus is too centered and the post on the right is very distracting. The photo would have been much better if the right was cropped off (just realized this is minimal editing and you can''t crop - but you could have composed it that way in camera). Then you have a much stronger photo with no distracting post on the right and the main post would start on the right and lead your eyes down the fence right through the photo.', '2016-10-19 15:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
